{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14822","headline":"和裴延龄尚书寄题果州谢舍人仙居 · 卢纶","name":"和裴延龄尚书寄题果州谢舍人仙居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘然去谒八仙翁，自地从天香满空。\n紫盖迥标双鹤上，语音犹在五云中。\n青溪不接渔樵路，丹井唯传草木风。\n歌此因思捧金液，露盘长庆汉皇宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}